# Line endings and binary detection.
#
# The repository is developed on Windows and run on Windows, macOS and Linux,
# so the tree is normalized to LF: every text file is stored LF and checked
# out LF. Windows batch files are the one deliberate exception (cmd.exe wants
# CRLF), and binary assets are marked so git never diffs, merges or converts
# them.

* text=auto eol=lf

# Windows batch files: CRLF in the working tree, on every platform.
*.bat text eol=crlf
*.cmd text eol=crlf

# Binary assets — no text conversion, no textual diff, no merge.
*.wasm binary
*.tgz binary
*.png binary
*.jpg binary
*.jpeg binary
*.gif binary
*.webp binary
*.ico binary
*.db binary
*.sqlite binary
*.sqlite3 binary
